<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/16th-century">16th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1520</h1><p class="ref-lede">1520 in world history: 9 events, 4 births and 5 deaths. 1,009 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
